# ---- pii-guard: deny-by-default for data and credentials ----
# New data files are ignored unless whitelisted below. The package's own
# datasets and the calamus-2016 fixtures are synthetic or de-identified and
# stay tracked; anything else needs `git add -f` after review.
# Data and serialized formats
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.rds
*.RData
*.rda
*.parquet
*.feather
*.sav
*.dta
*.sas7bdat
*.sqlite
*.db
*.accdb
